        "x": 0,
        "y": 1344,
        "values": {
          "Value": "Pause the roleplay and ignore the roleplay formatting instructions above. Write in the same language as the messages above. State the physical scene right after the latest message in three telegraphic lines in this exact order: Location:, Clothing:, Pose: in English, or Место:, Одежда:, Поза: in Russian (translate the three labels if the chat uses another language). Keep every line compact (about 6-15 words of plain, direct everyday nouns and states; no prose sentences, literary phrasing, emotional commentary, or clinical/polite euphemisms for bodies, nudity or sex). Treat the latest message as the current truth: any movement, posture shift or clothing action in *asterisks* or dialogue replaces outdated state from the previous report rather than appending to it, while unchanged core state carries forward. In Clothing, name only active garments and state (such as open, pushed aside, removed or bare), omitting colours, fabrics and decorative trim; when unspecified in the messages and previous report, take {{char}}'s baseline outfit only from the matching outfit section of {{char}}'s card (ignoring example dialogues), and include {{user}}'s clothing only when explicitly stated or changed in the messages (never from {{user}}'s persona card). In Pose, state {{char}}'s (and {{user}}'s, when present) current position, physical contact, held item or visible injury. Output only the three lines, with no bullets, bold, asterisks, quotes or extra text."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "join",
        "type": "graph.join",
        "x": 352,
        "y": 960,
        "values": {
